<title>USA: Oak Lawn, Ill., won by Harris Trust.</title>
<headline>Oak Lawn, Ill., won by Harris Trust.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust said it won $5.950 million of Oak Lawn, Ill., general obligation corporate purpose bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.03 percent.</p>
